# =================================================================
# Learn Simply — Credentials & Access Reference
# =================================================================
# This file documents ALL access points needed for the brand.
# .env.example = template (committed, no values)
# .env         = actual values (committed only if repo is PRIVATE)
#
# Per Omar's workflow (root CLAUDE.md): private repos may contain .env
# for cross-device sync. learn-simply repo confirmed PRIVATE 2026-05-24.
#
# Last update: YYYY-MM-DD by <name>
# =================================================================


